  "summary": "Eric is a staff software engineer @PingIdentity and works on authentication and orchestration features in the PingOne platform. Formerly, he was the test automation lead for PingDirectory, where he created and maintained internal tools, frameworks, and CI/CD pipelines, improved the developer experience, and promoted test case automation with the QA team.\n\nEric has years of experience building microservices with RESTful APIs using technologies like Java, Spring, Cassandra, Kafka, Docker, Kubernetes, and Amazon Web Services (AWS). He is also proficient with Python and Javascript, and has built responsive UIs with both React and Vue.",
